  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/348126/Spheres-Apocrypha-Radiant-and-Righteous?affiliate_id=549120\">Spheres Apocrypha: Radiant and Righteous</a></sup></p>\n<p>The night is hard and the night is long, but you know deep down, you can brave it.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Heroic Resolve, ability to gain martial focus, Cha 15 or Con 15, good alignment.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you activate heroic resolve and suppress a condition, you may instead suppress it for a number of rounds equal to the highest bonus between your Charisma or Constitution modifier.</p>\n<p>If the chosen condition originates from an evil-aligned creature or object or a creature or object with an evil aura or the evil sub-type, you may activate heroic resolve as a swift action.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/champion-feats#toc106\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
